@startuml
actor Pelanggan
participant "Browser/Frontend" as FE
participant "Express Server" as Server
database "MySQL DB (XAMPP)" as DB
actor Administrator

Pelanggan -> FE: Pilih Paket & Klik Pesan
FE -> Server: POST /booking (Data Pemesanan)
Server -> DB: INSERT INTO bookings (...)
DB --> Server: Booking ID
Server --> FE: Response (201 Created, Booking ID)

FE -> Pelanggan: Tampilkan Detail Pembayaran & Form
Pelanggan -> FE: Upload Bukti Bayar
FE -> Server: POST /booking/id/payment (File + Data)
Server -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (...)
Server -> DB: UPDATE bookings SET status='waiting'
DB --> Server: OK
Server --> FE: Response (Menunggu Verifikasi)

Administrator -> Server: GET /admin/bookings
Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM bookings WHERE status='waiting'
DB --> Server: Data Booking
Server --> Administrator: Render Dashboard

Administrator -> Server: POST /admin/booking/id/approve
Server -> DB: UPDATE bookings SET status='approved'
DB --> Server: OK
Server --> Administrator: Response (Booking Disetujui)
@enduml